1
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:32,930
What's next?

2
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,880
What's your plan?

3
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,640
I used to think

4
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,160
that as long as I endured and obeyed,

5
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,600
I could get what I wanted,

6
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,920
protect myself and Granny,

7
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,460
and protect Yanzhi Pavilion.

8
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,840
But as long as the Zuirong Cult exists,

9
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,480
my life is not in my own hands.

10
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:00,680
How can I protect others?

11
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,880
Granny's death,

12
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,720
I must avenge it.

13
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,730
Have you found a chance?

14
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,720
Not yet.

15
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,320
Aren't I useless?

16
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,600
Taking revenge on her

17
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,520
is indeed not easy.

18
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,260
What about you?

19
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,280
Leaving the Cheng family behind

20
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,920
and running back from the racecourse.

21
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,320
Won't there be problems?

22
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,440
As for the Cheng family,

23
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,240
you don't need to feel burdened.

24
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,479
I already have a plan.

25
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,720
When the time is right,

26
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,380
Father will definitely change his mind.

27
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,880
Your methods,

28
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,380
I naturally trust.

29
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,479
What's wrong?

30
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,480
Poisoning.

31
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:22,680
The poison she has taken is somewhat strange.

32
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,800
The toxin

33
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:26,320
seeped in through her skin.

34
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,760
Look,

35
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,240
these red rashes around her heart.

36
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,320
This is a chronic but highly lethal poison.

37
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,960
And it seems she

38
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,360
has been poisoned for quite some time.

39
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,520
The toxin

40
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:42,700
has traveled through her bloodstream to her heart.

41
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,720
I'm afraid...

42
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,420
Whatever it takes,

43
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,000
you must save her life.

44
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,520
First, we must identify the source of the poison

45
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,360
so we can prescribe the right remedy.

46
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,880
Look at this.

47
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,640
It actually contains Qionghua.

48
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,280
That makes sense.

49
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:20,200
This rouge has Qionghua in it.

50
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,240
Qionghua is inherently non-toxic,

51
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:25,840
but if it mixes with Ningzhihong in the rouge,

52
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,880
it becomes highly toxic.

53
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,880
Can it be cured?

54
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,640
I

55
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:34,000
will do my best to wake her up.

56
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:37,720
But to completely eradicate the poison from her body...

57
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,800
I'm afraid...

58
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,500
it will be very difficult.

59
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:41,680
Thank you for your trouble.

60
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,560
Whatever medicine

61
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,360
or manpower you need,

62
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,040
just ask.

63
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:45,920
Here.

64
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,850
You really aren't afraid of death.

65
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,480
Given her condition,

66
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:18,200
I'm afraid ordinary medicine won't work.

67
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,240
I do have a prescription.

68
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,880
But it is extremely dangerous.

69
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,240
Someone needs to test it first

70
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,920
in case it's too potent

71
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,640
and ends up harming her.

72
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,040
Young Master.

73
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,920
I should test this medicine.

74
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,600
How can I let you take such a risk?

75
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,040
Since Xin'er left,

76
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:44,780
you've been the most important person to me.

77
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,740
How could I let you take that risk?

78
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,120
If it weren't for you,

79
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:52,360
I would have died at the hands of that wicked master long ago.

80
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,200
My life belongs to you.

81
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,560
It's fine.

82
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,570
Before, for Xin'er's sake,

83
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,140
I plotted to take her life.

84
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:05,380
Now it's time to pay her back with one.

85
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,680
Young Master.

86
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,720
Young Master.

87
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:25,010
Let me help you rest for a while.

88
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,000
You're awake.

89
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,960
I owe you again.

90
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,760
The debt between us

91
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,040
is impossible to settle now.

92
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:13,800
Was it worth it?

93
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,920
For a Yanzhi Pavilion,

94
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,660
you didn't even care about your life.

95
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,680
I always felt that

96
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:25,480
rather than surviving in a courtyard

97
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,080
just getting by,

98
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,200
it's better

99
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,280
to be a fleeting firework,

100
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:34,010
having a moment of brilliance.

101
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,840
But now,

102
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,400
I want to be a bright lamp.

103
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,960
The night in Kuizhou

104
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:45,520
is

105
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,200
not so easy to light up.

106
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,840
Then I'll find a way

107
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,860
to light up a thousand,

108
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,610
a million lamps.

109
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,500
Speaking of which,

110
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,560
This Qionghua poison

111
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,920
reminds me of an old matter.

112
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,520
Madam Li used to be

113
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,080
a skinny woman too.

114
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,600
I heard that

115
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,240
after a serious illness,

116
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,200
she became plump

117
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,970
and won the Commander's favor.

118
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:28,800
So,

119
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,680
this Qionghua rouge,

120
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,800
how did you get it?

121
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,400
It's a relic from my grandmother

122
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,000
kept in the attic of Yanzhi Pavilion.

123
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:42,200
I found it by chance

124
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,650
after my grandmother passed away.

125
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,800
As for how she got it,

126
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,600
I have no idea.

127
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,320
So,

128
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,120
you can't be sure

129
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,440
that this Qionghua rouge

130
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,810
is the only one you have.

131
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,000
True.

132
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,960
Qionghua

133
00:07:58,159 --> 00:08:00,160
isn't native to the Central Plains.

134
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,530
When I was studying that rouge,

135
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,980
I read many ancient books from the Western Regions.

136
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,960
I suppose

137
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,320
this rouge

138
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,810
might be from the Western Regions too.

139
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,440
I remember.

140
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,880
When I was first adopted,

141
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,720
Madam Li was already plump.

142
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,560
Once,

143
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,080
she had a severe cold.

144
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,880
I went to attend to her

145
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:33,120
and saw something on her chest...

146
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,600
Red spots.

147
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,400
Exactly.

148
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,039
Are you sure?

149
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,360
If Madam Li really

150
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,440
has the transforming rouge too,

151
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:42,799
what

152
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,880
are you going to do?

153
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,920
Sorry,

154
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,360
I feel a bit weak after taking the medicine.

155
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,440
The method you mentioned

156
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,200
is too risky.

157
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:44,360
But

158
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,780
we can give it a try.

159
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:50,000
You agreed?

160
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,280
The road ahead is dangerous.

161
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,240
Recover first.

162
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,240
Since you knew that the Cheng girl

163
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:26,440
was having an affair with a servant,

164
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,240
why didn't you say it earlier?

165
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,400
First, I was considering

166
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:34,240
the reputation of both families.

167
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,040
Second,

168
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,440
it's understandable that

169
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,050
she loves someone else.

170
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,320
If I exposed her,

171
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,000
it would make our Commander's Mansion

172
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,160
seem like we are abusing our power.

173
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:43,920
Worse still,

174
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:47,620
I was afraid it would hurt your friendship with General Cheng.

175
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:51,100
You know the proper way to handle things.

176
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,800
You have indeed grown up.

177
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,080
You've been wronged.

178
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,720
Since that Cheng girl

179
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,040
has a bad character,

180
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,560
let's call off

181
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,120
this marriage for now.

182
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,060
Thank you, Father.

183
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:39,760
Madam.

184
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:42,120
The Governor and Master are discussing matters inside.

185
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,380
The Governor ordered,

186
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,280
without being summoned,

187
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:44,560
no one is allowed in.

188
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,640
Blind servant.

189
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,480
How dare you stop Madam?

190
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,040
Not even me?

191
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:49,960
Yes, Madam.

192
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,480
The Governor specifically instructed

193
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,520
that if Madam comes,

194
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,080
please move to the side hall.

195
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,200
Dog servant.

196
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:57,960
Madam.

197
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,160
Good.

198
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,520
Very good.

199
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,000
I'm sorry.

200
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,690
For all these years,

201
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,330
I have been lying to you.

202
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:31,400
Pavilion Master, you have suffered.

203
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,840
I knew it.

204
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,600
The Pavilion Master would never abandon us.

205
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,640
I knew it.

206
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,840
Pavilion Master.

207
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:38,280
Pavilion Master.

208
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,040
Pavilion Master.

209
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,210
Granny Lan's death,

210
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,680
we can't just let it go unpunished.

211
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,240
The Pavilion Master called us here.

212
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,440
She must have a plan.

213
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:50,600
Two things.

214
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:54,720
First,

215
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,200
we must secretly compile

216
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,440
a list of girls who have fallen victim to Madam Li over the years.

217
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,970
The more names, the better.

218
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,660
But you must act in absolute secrecy,

219
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,200
and never be discovered.

220
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,520
This is easy.

221
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:09,520
Our makeup artists visit various mansions every day,

222
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:12,850
so naturally, they can quietly gather a lot of information.

223
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,970
There's one more thing.

224
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:18,160
This is a friend of mine.

225
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,440
These days,

226
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:21,240
I have been asking her

227
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,080
to search the Western Regions

228
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,410
for a way to counter that poisonous rouge.

229
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:27,330
She wrote to me a while ago saying she had found

230
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,800
something.

231
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,840
She will send it to Wuming Workshop.

232
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,360
But

233
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:33,040
with the Makeup Ceremony Finals approaching,

234
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,500
I don't have time to get it.

235
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:37,000
Please fetch it for me

236
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,160
and make sure to deliver it to Qiwu Courtyard.

237
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,240
Qiwu Courtyard?

238
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,220
Why deliver it to Qiwu Courtyard?

239
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:48,240
Tomorrow is the Makeup Ceremony Finals.

240
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,370
When the time comes,

241
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,370
I will first compete as Qingcheng.

242
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:11,040
Present the gifts.

243
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,160
Tonight,

244
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:15,760
we will use the flame pattern of this Chu artifact as the theme.

245
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,200
Pavilion Masters, please

246
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,760
use the moonlight as silk,

247
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,480
and the flame pattern as a guide,

248
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,520
to paint the night of Kuizhou with

249
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,880
the most touching dark makeup.

250
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,160
The incense has been lit.

251
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:32,000
Pavilion Masters, please use the items in your hands

252
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,760
within the given time

253
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,800
to complete Madam's task.

254
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,490
Once the incense burns out,

255
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,840
each Pavilion Master

256
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:41,000
must wait quietly behind the curtain.

257
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,440
After the makeup envoys switch places,

258
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:46,240
the winner will be determined by a blind selection.

259
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:49,360
I hope you all use your ingenuity

260
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:52,720
and do not let down this beautiful prime time.

261
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,080
Time is up.

262
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,680
The incense has burned out.

263
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:45,080
Pavilion Masters, please wait inside the tent.

264
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:48,440
Makeup envoys, please step forward in random order

265
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,080
for Madam's inspection.

266
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:05,960
Whose envoy is this?

267
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:07,880
Quickly remove the veil.

268
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,040
Forgive me, Madam.

269
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:11,610
I was the one who asked her to keep the veil.

270
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,720
Because this veil

271
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:14,920
is part of the Flaming Phoenix makeup.

272
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:17,880
I beg you to allow this makeup to be shown in full,

273
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:19,880
and then the veil will be removed.

274
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:24,320
Please step a little closer to the candle, my lady.

275
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,680
How did you do that?

276
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,080
To answer your question, Madam.

277
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,680
I first grind the Luodai

278
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,360
into a very fine powder,

279
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:47,690
and separate the brightest layer of the mica powder.

280
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,920
The veil is soaked in rouge water

281
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,640
and sifted with mica powder.

282
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:54,120
Let the fine shimmering light soak through the sheer veil,

283
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:56,780
and then use the Luodai powder to draw a phoenix.

284
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,560
Under the candlelight,

285
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,240
the phoenix on the veil

286
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:03,370
will match the flame pattern on the makeup model's face.

287
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,800
It is indeed exquisite.

288
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,440
What do you ladies think?

289
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:12,970
The makeup of the four pavilions each has its own merits.

290
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,680
But this Flaming Phoenix,

291
00:17:15,079 --> 00:17:17,480
truly like a phoenix rising from the ashes,

292
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:19,280
makes it impossible to look away.

293
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:20,520
It is truly

294
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,560
the makeup worthy of Madam.

295
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,040
This Flaming Phoenix,

296
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:26,240
which pavilion did this makeup?

297
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:32,280
It's Yanzhi Pavilion.

298
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:38,890
Please ask Pavilion Master Fang Qingcheng to step forward.

299
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:57,160
I am Fang Zhuozhuo, paying my respects to you, Madam.

300
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,080
And to all the noble ladies.
